Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you {\i1}are{\i0} Taichi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think we'll be\Nswitching bodies that oft—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you three switch bodies this time, or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kiriyama Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:34.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Aoki Yoshifumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Inaba Himeko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:13.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want some more tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to be in this totally uncute body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can't I switch bodies with Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that's the least of your worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:33.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please say I'm not going to be stuck like this forever!\NWe can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those two{\i0} were back to normal in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, Iori-chan, why don't you two go to class?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to stay with us until we're back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, skipping class like this is kind of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:48.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like we're some secret society.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's exciting!\NYou and your {\i1}optim{\i0}—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you... back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really think we need to do this, but it's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.45,0:03:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you make it look like I'm giving you the third degree?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I'll be eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's soba. Hate it when the noodles go soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys don't cause much trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I can't say I'm not curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:38.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, the first bite of hot food always goes down the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut to the chase, Gotou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Inaba...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be a liberal, cool-with-the-kids kind of teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which is why I let you guys call me Gossan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but talking down to me is kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should learn to {\i1}do{\i0} your job before talking about {\i1}how{\i0} to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind telling me who did our class's accounting during the cultural festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much again for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But could you please not talk about it when other teachers are around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were we talking about again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.\NSo what were you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}Aoki and Kiriyama didn't show up to class until third period either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some mini chocolate buns we shared yesterday had gone bad, so we all came in late with upset stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.61,0:04:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.61,0:04:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki and Kiriyama are talking with Hirata-sensei right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would they say the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so. I got no problems with it.\NYou can go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban's just amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how she can lie through her teeth with such confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd make a great con artist or swindler!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously...\NIf you can't say anything nice, just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you think Aoki and Kiriyama are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:05:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look like you've seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to find a place where I can be alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?!\NHello? Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why does this have to happen to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Kiriyama there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:38.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NIori's trying to keep her sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?\NI'm in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?!\NHello, Inaba? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I in the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did Taichi do?\NPut Taichi on, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're cleaning the bathrooms today. Don't bail on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bathrooms again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:23.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something happen?\NNo, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, cleaning took longer—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.53,0:06:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!\NYou...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got some explaining to do!\NWh-What?\NWhat's wrong, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What happened between you and Fujishima-san\N yesterday when we switched bodies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll decide if it's important or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, Iori-chan's lost it. First time I've seen that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I probably should've told you sooner, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You touched my boobs!\NI've been tainted!\N{\q2}I didn't know what was going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had to figure out somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When you were in my body earlier,\N you went to the girls' bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you...\NI was just trying to find a place to hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not important right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The real problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is Fujishima-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is the second problem worse than the first?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And seriously, what's up with Fujishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.09,0:07:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought anyone could get Iori so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your class president like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}Perfect manners, perfect grades, and the teachers all love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a model student.\NWho cares about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:51.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, how big are Iori-chan's b—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have {\i1}time{\i0} for pointless crap like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you want to know, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:08:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori's a C-cup.\NWhile we're at it, I'm a B, and Yui's an A.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you telling them that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about your boobs,\Nbut I love everything else about you!{That face.}{He's so charming.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:15.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get that look off your face! It pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what do you mean, "sorry"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are times when smaller is better!{Aoki's face.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Inaba's a B, and Kiriyama's an A.{}\NDon't act like you're not part of the problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:28.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The problem right now is Fujishima-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?!\NThe problem right now is this {\i1}body swapping{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,hello... there.\NGotou?\NHow long have you been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:54.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sick or something?\NThis body is perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:09:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This person is healthier than he needs to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:09:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just don't have any real motivation, determination, resolution, enthusiasm,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or anything else along those lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gossan, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came here because you're confused about how you're switching personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gossan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you kn—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and could you not call me Gossan or Gotou?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:38.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,not him, after all.\NThen...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...\Nwho are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see, how should I answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:10:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}If you want a name, "Balloon Vine" is something like one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Balloon Vine"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is your name the same as some obscure plant's?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh... Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:16.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm something like an observer for you five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You could say that I'm borrowing \NGotou-sensei's body right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're something else in Gossan's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is a good way to put it. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}Then you have something to do with us switching personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll be switching personalities among the five of you at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean that both the switched personalities and the time of the switch are completely random?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:55.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Very good, Nagase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:11:02.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's precisely as you say.\NAnd I will observe you while this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though, I won't watch you 24/7 for the sake of privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would require effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you all understand the situation now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was hardly an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it? Then I have a few questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:24.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, why us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next, is this whole thing under your control?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And how do we end it? What are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All very good questions.{Color in this guy's speech should be avoided.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the first question, it just so happens that you are some pretty interesting humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:47.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck? "Pretty interesting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And well, I want to watch you switch personalities
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.43,0:11:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to see if anything happens that'll make me say, "Oh, that was pretty interesting."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:12:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This will all end after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:12:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So when this ends {\i1}is{\i0} under your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just live your lives the way you normally would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:18.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's best if you don't think about \Nhow your personalities switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also advise against telling anyone about how you're switching personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would do more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping for the best from around the top of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.90,0:12:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still have plenty of questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.94,0:12:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that's not what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You'd better not think that everything\Nwill go exactly the way you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NYou...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Gossan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.14,0:13:19.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui was a karate champion in middle school, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the way Gossan usually moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when I checked on him in the faculty room...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?\NI was here, trying to get through this paperwork...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? I haven't gotten anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I fall asleep or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:59.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looked like he didn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!\NI don't understand {\i1}any{\i0} of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we overthink this, we might do exactly what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we tell someone about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably better if we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said that it would do more harm than good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NWe don't know how much of what he said was true,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it would definitely end up being a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:33.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want my mom to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The next time our personalities switch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,get in contact with the rest of us as soon as possible so we can grasp the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avoid people as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}If you run into someone, act like the person you switched with.\NGot it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H2E132B&\3c&H230E20&\t(991,2325,\c1\3c1\4c1)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a bit over a week since we agreed on that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:02.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just how careless can you people be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the most basic problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:09.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Raise your hand if you went into the wrong bathroom when you switched with someone of the opposite sex!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me.\NYou {\i1}idiots{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:14.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?!\NThat's the first thing that should be on your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a habit.\NIt's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}What's {\i1}normal{\i0} about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:21.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone{\i0} has to say {\i1}something{\i0} whenever we go, thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... can I make a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:27.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could we try going to the bathroom more often when we're not switched?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:31.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was {\i1}just{\i0} talking about how it's hard going to the bathroom now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}But if one of us girls switches with Taichi or Aoki and has to go to the bathroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we have to...\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's overdoing it with the rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! {Zettai yada, yada, yada!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Aoki and I will make sure we do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you so nice to Taichi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to make a big deal out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:58.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already learned how to pee standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a big deal if you ask me.\NAnd are you being serious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, what about our purity?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are our bodies safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perfectly. Right, Aoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, when I'm in a girl's body, there are a few things I'd like to try,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you're perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:26.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't had to go to the bathroom yet, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totally sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's times like these when we have to trust each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything stupid like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iori, when I switched with you a few nights ago, no one was home but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that it might be dangerous to leave a girl at home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:17:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never told you, but my parents are divorced and I live with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and my mom is really busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:09.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if someone were to break in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd just let loose on him with a can of pepper spray, then beat the crap out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:13.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not okay at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're in the most danger when you're complacent like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once it happens, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...\NUm...\NSorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long is this going to go on for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this Balloon Vine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. So this is how Aoki sees the world?\NHe's really tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait... Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Yui looks so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:03.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like I mind when you touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:08.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that you're in Aoki's body right now, so I jumped back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.93,0:18:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.\NI shouldn't have tried to touch you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like this personality switch is a long one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:29.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean that thing with Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you worried about something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it anything I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:51.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now it's Taichi's turn on Nagase Iori's Question Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:58.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone implicitly believes that we each have a soul, a consciousness, or a personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that they make us who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is why you would identify a combination of Aoki's body and Nagase Iori's soul as Nagase Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:18.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But souls, or personalities, are neither tangible nor visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:25.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}This is why we identify a person by their own physical body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, our bodies are the essence of our identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q0}But what if our bodies, through personality switching, for example, were no longer solely our own?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would we still be ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally!\NI'm back in my own body!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:09.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was like Nagase wasn't her usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though, I'm probably overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:17.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the way the wind is blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "the wind is blowing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need three volunteers from our class to participate in this month's city clean-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone willing to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gossan probably just volunteered our class to get out of a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm busy with my club. I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:40.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be one of the three, so we just need two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:52.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-san? You're volunteering?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...\NI'll do it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have fun, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get {\i1}off{\i0} me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:17.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm having a {\i1}wonderful{\i0} day, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make it up to you later, so please forgive me, Inaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi-kun, can I ask you a question?\NI'll be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your relationship with Nagase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you just in the same club?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.47,0:21:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should make it {\i1}perfectly{\i0} clear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori's {\i1}my{\i0} woman!\NKeep your hands off her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever a guy comes close, your body starts shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:21:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way you're looking at me is kind of scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:00.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.62,0:22:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Selfless freak.
